{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【ACGHK 2026】「csl」攤位報導！體驗《漫威鬥魂》試玩，還有Galaxy最新智慧型手機登場</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/35df362982374fa34bcb94ed8516550ca771e3cc55a66a4ff1e3c97062969429/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd8493971097f3708877acc1915f09ff9\"/><p>於2026年7月24日（五）至7月28日（二）期間舉辦的「 ACGHK 2026 」，正式名稱為「 Ani-Com &amp; Games Hong Kong 2026 （香港動漫電玩節2026）」。 這次將為大家帶來電信業者「 csl 」攤位的現場報導！</p><h3>從PS5遊戲試玩到最新科技產品！「csl」攤位報導</h3><p>「csl」攤位</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/07ea50a999881b53d5b4459e5f0434800f76207b1482f66126e10a8b1c0d9fc4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2fc55109b4c13f92c657e20e1427bfa8\"/><p>電信業者「csl」攤位展出了與PlayStation 5、Xbox、Samsung等相關的展示內容，並舉辦舞台活動。</p><p>活力滿滿的表演</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/18ed9d106e972f60cb633627de4b65ad3d78cedfa1f54dd3661e76eab93925d4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9ce05aa285ba7c9761b085182c8e3644\"/><p>啦啦隊成員登場，炒熱現場氣氛。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b82dc4496179b9bef85767e9c58999f73972a33eaf89c0f18acbb7f07aa3a97d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F24aaa1ca18ccb1e71a683934dff75ab5\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b4a083fa171768dedd9eb0a661168c60474a62c143f498be29a7e1f19881a762/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7de3984ee5f41e7d784090dfe2301b4b\"/><p>預定於 2026年8月7日（四） 發售的《 漫威鬥魂 （MARVEL Tōkon: Fighting Souls）》試玩區登場！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a2a11b057a5f0760fe8e05bae87270fa51ffc9f4b98f00f4ce31c890e044e012/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F771619303158bcddf77ec6ed69b37b40\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f8ffea4fcb96800f76e59df1126481ffaf55a56eecf745c899fd328d2669110b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F762ad7f6a5d861c6fc19e1396ee2e290\"/><p>來場者可以操控各種英雄角色，享受熱血對戰。</p><p>漫威英雄們</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b9a6f8bbe6d6483545d22f14e925fc2def1cc83ac30bb53759136e4818f52a5c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0eb6311e392dd6388f4755a9d523e121\"/><p>鋼鐵人、美國隊長等角色的迷你壓克力立牌。 可愛的模樣讓人忍不住想全部收集。</p><p>未上市作品試玩區</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/88516cf06b8d9cdf3f1baf2a2be717532f495d428a52bc9cb37b889932ec6596/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8ef23338996732084478d955594abfbf\"/><p>現場也提供預定於 2027年 發售的《 七龍珠 超宇宙3 》，以及預定於 2026年8月27日（四） 發售的《 隊長小翼2 世界群星 》試玩。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f06ecdee40d70e21c3208369a041defc48d20162e0193d9c90e9ae78f940839d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2045377e0c94504a1a639ec75a26240e\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1aa0061a2806b9ec0d268d5f250dd272383af337cc19f0560537efe473f24a82/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd65b23fe12ce6880768abbf3eaf8b6aa\"/><p>許多玩家聚集於此，搶先體驗尚未上市的新作。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e5a7f75754deaf040d88b71d3c2d3d41a41c40d19d30b5870d58c36d232c492d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc5d8b7b39c74c3c73947f6e0555e802b\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/720e2db526a00cb35545c8a903fabea79b0a0c282c8b537066bb634d0614680f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F704968d17160a6855225b074bbe2b54c\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7d3634ea727f86473e025b6ffeceb0366dd8459f55598e109c4a758aae99e1af/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb7e35eac336f8a1f5db367db614b4526\"/><p>PlayStation 5與Xbox控制器＆主機外殼也有展示及販售！</p><p>吸引目光的是色彩繽紛漸層設計的「極限流行系列」。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5468631781cd85f6f201c8003e0244170cb45a2c7443422c03c0729d8271dc54/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F51bd387ff059525314675ec17dbe7b38\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/38ffa417179cb8acca908506ab2b1eaaf7d021e399d1b2bd34b0486d3fef0840/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fde6e310a91c442860e353b672a3bfd5a\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9cfd6dc6fdf9d01f238ef2af2daeded5bd7e90e9bbcc850cacdc979a52c17e72/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fcb97dfa2b18b9c75a59aee6e26c240e8\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/07eff287734dd5f83d12a5abc58383c780e402c3798250130ad19af168675142/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6075714ac3a8e3d7ef1526d1340dca02\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/78141665395dfdf177d54e12e7094978621884051436df18e4604220cdb55d26/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F041dc5271071ad27f63e1c0bfd180742\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/03dde002b7dd67c342d2cb5f8858cf29732cbf1ae5bfd47b670914ad678c6ab1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff44ba99772185ead226e1dc1f6503e8d\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f8a37c7869de8c832f8b20606d783469d1fea83ce3ddd4b6e8ad7e4cf3c1fb53/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbbc5c18c420a9c536cda5bb733cef8d2\"/><p>多款不同設計風格的控制器整齊展示。 光是欣賞外觀，就令人心情愉悅。</p><p>PS5主機半價優惠！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1aaf4809eb5b922d3cb743017d4868893d77ad20afc2eb3e4138fd3b0a1f892a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa6baae93d4b14e0ff5e1d33c7731f757\"/><p>PS5主機限量推出半價優惠！非常划算！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/39132ce4057107cf01b538ef85b2ef4619a731111c02452a4bef64da89f18262/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F524093a5da98ef6c1bae80583ded79ac\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/364cd4670f0701f6b7a0f095b87dd4af72f5b1da08e1c76891cea30268059528/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd7897cbefbb2c80f5426c4c9bc480b99\"/><p>在以高速網路與Samsung OLED螢幕體驗「 F1 25 」的展示區中，玩家們享受了震撼感十足的賽車競速體驗。</p><p>Samsung Galaxy Watch系列智慧手錶</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f884bb835c94bf0452f9b6156aeaef81a3ef2445477c82538bb5f1e4e5a2e6fc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F094093a2093f10563115d7ac34dda716\"/><p>智慧手錶 Galaxy Watch 系列 搭載明亮高亮度顯示器，即使螢幕清晰易讀，也不會讓人感覺尺寸過大。</p><p>「Galaxy Z Fold8」系列</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/999ba94fe86363f2b2e7ef9658d42106d7a41fad2922a88a296b6b76024b8f90/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F75e05b1c2bb6c53e41ece8d6ab42936f\"/><p>發現全新摺疊智慧型手機「 Galaxy Z Fold8 」系列 推出3種尺寸版本，可依照個人喜好選擇。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e5f4b9794f58b94a5d12e3bce1f65182b9fb39484d0f79c7231d8532ab79b2e2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7f24d03e4af965ef17ac85ba11fc6b30\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3c73da3fa521e94163f9ff5007ba345581c790e7eccb80c27cfda09e51a9b78d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fda877360c57d1ec0c84f54345aa670dc\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6bbc4a34281dd9eb5007a0cc5b4c4a22676eb96b63f5cf6401460b347dda4eeb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2406fe6c34e1355b6aee897a5b0bb511\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ba639385840f71801e02398bbabda3c14a345fa93c287ee590c5f3c59213b879/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7a750f90431824d23e264de8c6e2aaf4\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8a45db235d62449e6585a74268da23a45841f16b31366a61f8d5039ba1e70498/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5fd79477d167834afd72323f846a3906\"/><p>大尺寸螢幕能夠收納於小巧機身中，同時兼具時尚設計！ 不愧是Samsung。</p><p>免費體驗！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/704c30035b08ec400aa1179012bea978e6481278996f17189a9885aae5505bde/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1655b9ec23e123d374d118ee98c6a75b\"/><p>在Galaxy S26系列智慧型手機上，利用AI製作原創虛擬角色的「 C伙AI契約者照相館 」體驗區。</p><p>火屬性的麥可・傑克森</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/367e5512d1ed304c14d3d9ebba5b0b4fbf8d8e4197216d2a06696c47f66b304a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F876823e53825629177dbe5d841cdf42c\"/><p>連近期電影大熱的麥可・傑克森也能角色化！ 火屬性形象非常適合他。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/eeb18e62eaf9988f3abd096ef8c334a5d9dda91a2ac613d081fb12b405ef581d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5a79135cb6d20977caaf30bfe66a9ced\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fa73a4ec075bca48b32fcbe22346316d1338dbe17a624ac43129507224982070/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff50b235e49917dee3984e3687cdb33af\"/><p>在HONOR展示區，舉辦了讓來場者體驗「 HONOR Magic V6 」驚人抗拉強度的「 引體向上挑戰 」。 即使成年男性吊掛在手機上，也能承受重量，其強度令人驚訝！</p><p>AI聯動錄音筆</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5fe359fb65c3d9291fb8af6429c458d9e7c8f2db8464d8503f6c8103a1c86ff5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F12eccd7175f7047ff29e3f5105124f98\"/><p>會議與採訪不可或缺的 Plaud 系列產品。 編輯部也正在使用，AI能自動整理錄音內容並生成摘要，真的非常方便。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/96cfedb0ce65215b7975b8fa79b2ef749fc1a0e8c98f0c08eab73dfe47eb8ca3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F79df5655a13bac64583b9fdaf5c853ba\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4a1bbdc3c2d34c96506f0144f7dd4f65befed7e3367b3755c39fe7cad118895b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbe50d2069898d0cd45426a383d6244b3\"/><p>此外，現場也展示了非常適合記錄日常生活與旅程的Insta360，以及Vivo智慧型手機。</p><p>眼鏡化身AI助理</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8b3ff644ed72dff113ed506088b3078decc3b890bebdb52039ef4ddaf839e5c6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1631e6fd71ab01152322985f4bde4039\"/><p>搭載最新AI技術的「 Rokid Smart AI Glass 」。 只要像普通眼鏡一樣戴上，就能透過AI分析眼前所看到的事物，並進行即時語言翻譯，是一款讓人感受到未來科技的產品。</p><p>以上就是能感受到全球高科技魅力的「csl」攤位報導！</p><p>🔸【ACGHK 2026】「Bushiroad」「Hot Toys」攤位直擊！TCG 體驗區、4.5 公尺巨大蜘蛛人吸睛登場 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「Monster Hunter Outlanders」攤位報導！試玩體驗及限定週邊贈品 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「萬代南夢宮」攤位照片報導！鋼彈、Tamagotchi等人氣IP大集合 🔸【ACGHK 2026】迎接20週年的「ROG」攤位報導！鍵盤、滑鼠等人氣電競週邊齊聚一堂 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「爆旋陀螺」攤位報導！歷代型號至最新型號齊聚一堂展示</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-31T15:12:47.697017+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1579,"images":39,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}